<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="description" content="Novera Systems provides managed IT, cloud operations and workplace support for growing organisations.">
  <title>Novera Systems</title>
  <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
  <style>
    :root{color-scheme:light;--navy:#17243b;--blue:#1769e0;--pale:#eef4fb;--line:#d7dee8;--text:#26364d;--muted:#657187}
    *{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff;color:var(--text);font:16px/1.55 Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
    .wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.top{background:var(--navy);color:#dbe6f6;font-size:.8rem}.top .wrap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:8px 0}
    header{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff}.header{height:72px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between}.logo{font-size:1.18rem;font-weight:750;color:var(--navy)}.logo span{color:var(--blue)}
    nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;font-size:.92rem}nav a:hover{color:var(--blue)}.button{display:inline-block;padding:11px 18px;border-radius:5px;background:var(--blue);color:#fff;font-weight:700}
    .hero{background:var(--pale);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.hero .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:70px;padding:76px 0}
    .eyebrow{margin-bottom:14px;color:var(--blue);font-size:.77rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}h1{max-width:680px;margin:0 0 22px;color:var(--navy);font-size:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4.4rem);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.035em}.lead{max-width:620px;margin:0 0 30px;color:#506178;font-size:1.16rem}
    .panel{align-self:center;padding:28px;border:1px solid #cbd7e7;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 10px 30px #2136570f}.panel h2{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--navy);font-size:1.1rem}.panel ul{margin:0;padding:0;list-style:none}.panel li{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:13px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}.tick{color:#16804b;font-weight:900}
    .section{padding:70px 0}.section-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:40px;align-items:end;margin-bottom:30px}.section h2{margin:0;color:var(--navy);font-size:2rem}.section-head p{max-width:520px;margin:0;color:var(--muted)}
    .services{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:18px}.service{padding:25px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:7px}.service b{display:block;margin-bottom:10px;color:var(--navy);font-size:1.05rem}.service p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.93rem}
    .contact{margin-bottom:70px;padding:34px 38px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:30px}.contact h2{margin:0 0 6px}.contact p{margin:0;color:#c8d4e7}.contact .button{background:#fff;color:var(--navy)}
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:27px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:.82rem}.footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}
    @media(max-width:760px){.top{display:none}.header{height:64px}nav a:not(.button){display:none}.hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px;padding:52px 0}.services{grid-template-columns:1fr}.section-head,.contact{display:block}.section-head p{margin-top:12px}.contact .button{margin-top:22px}.footer{display:block}.footer span{display:block;margin-top:6px}}
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="top"><div class="wrap"><span>IT operations and workplace support</span><span>Support desk: Monday–Friday, 08:00–18:00</span></div></div>
  <header><div class="wrap header"><a class="logo" href="/">Novera<span>.</span></a><nav><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#approach">How we work</a><a href="mailto:hello@__DOMAIN__">Contact</a><a class="button" href="mailto:support@__DOMAIN__">Support</a></nav></div></header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div><div class="eyebrow">Managed technology services</div><h1>Reliable IT for teams that need to keep moving.</h1><p class="lead">We help small and mid-sized organisations run secure workplaces, cloud platforms and day-to-day technical support.</p><a class="button" href="#services">View our services</a></div><aside class="panel"><h2>What we look after</h2><ul><li><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Employee devices and access</span></li><li><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Cloud systems and backups</span></li><li><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Monitoring, updates and support</span></li><li><span class="tick">✓</span><span>Security reviews and planning</span></li></ul></aside></div></section>
    <section class="wrap section" id="services"><div class="section-head"><h2>Practical support, clearly delivered</h2><p>One team for routine requests, preventative maintenance and longer-term improvements.</p></div><div class="services"><article class="service"><b>Managed workplace</b><p>Device setup, identity management, patching and responsive help for employees.</p></article><article class="service"><b>Cloud operations</b><p>Monitoring, backup checks, capacity planning and structured change management.</p></article><article class="service"><b>Security foundations</b><p>Access reviews, baseline policies and straightforward advice tailored to your risks.</p></article></div></section>
    <section class="wrap contact" id="approach"><div><h2>Planning a change or need a second opinion?</h2><p>Send a short outline and our team will respond during business hours.</p></div><a class="button" href="mailto:hello@__DOMAIN__">Contact Novera</a></section>
  </main>
  <footer><div class="wrap footer"><span>© Novera Systems</span><span>__DOMAIN__ · Privacy · Service terms</span></div></footer>
</body>
</html>
